      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am not encounting this issue on nvidia 440.64.0 with proton 5.0-5.\nOne difference for me is that permissions for youtube-dl.exe just get ignored by vrchat on my system. I just replace it with an empty file every time it gets overwriten.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
