      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The problem is no more after the proton version upgrade, so to anyone having this problem in windows, I recommend they check their graphics drivers and windows updates. It is possible that the problem is also not present depending on your windows version/edition (or mimicked windows version for Proton).\nPS: After some more testing, I still see some hiccups, though they are not as pronounced.",
